  include trick or treating\, DJ Matt spinning spooky tunes\, kids&rsquo\; 
 activities\, a movie at Portside + more.</p><p>Don&rsquo\;t forget to stic
 k around to see the skies come alive during the SPECTRA Laser Light Show.<
 /p><p>See you&hellip\;here!&nbsp\;</p><p>Date + Time: Wednesday\, October 
 28 | 6 pm (Kid&rsquo\;s activities begin at 5 pm)&nbsp\;</p><p>Where: Main
  Street / Portside&nbsp\;</p><p>Cost: FREE admission + parking\; Some acti
 vities cost&nbsp\;</p><p>Other: The Island Church will provide bags for ca
 ndy in case anyone forgot to bring one DJ Matt will play music on Main Str
 eet Kids activities include: Rock wall\, bounce house\, mechanical bull\, 
 face painter\, the reptile bus + pony rides&nbsp\;</p><p>Event Schedule:&n
 bsp\;</p><p>5 pm: Kids activities begin&nbsp\;</p><p>6 pm: Trunk or Treat&
 nbsp\;</p><p>7 pm: &lsquo\;Monsters University&rsquo\; playing at Portside
 &nbsp\;</p><p>8 + 8:30 pm: SPECTRA Laser Light Show</p></body></html>\n\n-
