 \; position: relative\; max-width: 100%\; cursor: pointer\; padding: 0px 1
 px\;" width="100%" height="403" fr-original-style="width: 100%\;" fr-origi
 nal-class="fr-draggable" /><br /></p><p>Presented by <a fr-original-style=
 "" href="https://www.vulcaninc.com/" style="user-select: auto\;"><strong f
 r-original-style="" style="font-weight: 700\;">Vulcan\, Inc.</strong></a>
 \, the <a fr-original-style="" href="https://www.southbaldwinchamber.com/l
 eadership-series/" style="user-select: auto\;"><strong fr-original-style="
 " style="font-weight: 700\;">Leadership Series</strong></a> is one of the 
 South Baldwin Chamber of Commerce&rsquo\;s premier programs designed to ke
 ep members informed\, engaged\, and connected to the issues shaping our re
 gion. Hosted eight times each year\, these luncheons feature respected\, i
 nfluential speakers who bring insight on timely topics affecting our busin
 ess community.</p><p>From economic development and tourism to local govern
 ance and state-level initiatives\, each program delivers relevant\, real-w
 orld perspective you can take back to your business or organization. Just 
 as important\, the Leadership Series provides valuable opportunities to bu
 ild relationships with fellow professionals\, civic leaders\, and key deci
 sion-makers from across South Baldwin County.</p><hr fr-original-style="" 
 style="clear: both\; user-select: none\; break-after: page\;" /><h4>Agenda
 </h4><ul fr-original-style="" style="list-style-position: inside\;"><li>11
 :00 AM: Private Workforce &amp\; Top Investors&#39\; Meeting</li><li>11:30
  AM: Buffet Lunch catered by <a fr-original-style="" href="https://alabama
 coastalcatering.com/" style="user-select: auto\;">Alabama Coastal Catering
 </a></li><li>12:00 PM: Program Begins</li></ul><hr fr-original-style="" st
 yle="clear: both\; user-select: none\; break-after: page\;" /><h4>Investin
 g in the Future</h4><p>We are proud to recognize our Education Enrichment 
 Sponsor\, <a fr-original-style="" href="https://warrenaverett.com/offices/
 daphne" style="user-select: auto\;"><strong fr-original-style="" style="fo
 nt-weight: 700\;">Warren Averett</strong></a>\, for helping connect today&
 rsquo\;s students with tomorrow&rsquo\;s opportunities.</p><hr fr-original
 -style="" style="clear: both\; user-select: none\; break-after: page\;" />
 <h4>Community Spotlight &mdash\; Local Nonprofit Partners</h4><p>We are ho
 nored to highlight two organizations making a meaningful impact across Bal
 dwin County:</p><ul fr-original-style="" style="list-style-position: insid
 e\;"><li><a fr-original-style="" href="https://businesshub.southbaldwincha
 mber.com/list/Details/united-way-of-baldwin-county-4616107" style="user-se
 lect: auto\;">United Way of Baldwin County</a></li><li><a fr-original-styl
 e="" href="https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/list/Details/crossp
 oint-baptist-church-4616141" style="user-select: auto\;">Crosspoint Baptis
 t Church</a></li></ul><p><br /></p></body></html>\n\n---\n🌐 View origin
 al event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/202
