 onn brings his hilarious live show to OWA Theater on October 2nd for a nig
 ht of laugh-out-loud storytelling.\nWith nearly 600k Facebook followers an
 d millions of views across Facebook\, TikTok\, and Instagram\, Andrew Conn
  has become one of the most viewed comedians on social media. Known for hi
 s outlandish storytelling\, hilarious facial expressions\, and relatable S
 outhern humor\, Conn brings the same energy that made him a viral sensatio
 n to the OWA Theater stage.\nFrom family and relationships to everyday Sou
 thern life\, Andrew Conn's comedy is relatable\, outrageous\, and guarante
 ed to have you laughing. He has performed and headlined across the country
