 reciation-1945238@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title></head><body aria-di
 sabled="false" spellcheck="false"><p>Join us as we celebrate Public Power 
 &amp\; Public Natural Gas Week and 110 years of growing alongside Baldwin 
 County.&nbsp\;</p><p>This week is all about celebrating our customers and 
 the employees who keep our communities connected every day. As your locall
 y owned\, not-for-profit utility\, we&#39\;re proud to provide dependable
 \, affordable services and reinvest right here in the communities we call 
 home. Everyone is invited!&nbsp\;</p><p>This year\, we&#39\;re celebrating
  with Coffee with the Crew!&nbsp\;</p><p>Stop by Drowsy Poet at the Foley 
 Station\, grab a cup on us\, and spend the morning with the people behind 
 Riviera. We&#39\;ll have vintage photos from our archives on display\, sha
 ring some of the people\, places\, and moments that have shaped our 110-ye
 ar history.&nbsp\;</p><p>Come for the coffee\, stay for the stories &mdash
 \; and celebrate 110 years with us.&nbsp\;</p><p>☕🧡💛 📍 Drowsy P
 oet | Foley&nbsp\;</p><p>📆 Tuesday\, Oct. 6&nbsp\;</p><p>⏰ 7&ndash\;9
  a.m.&nbsp\;</p><p>☕ Coffee&rsquo\;s on Riviera!</p></body></html>\n\n--
 -\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/c
 alendar/Details/coffee-on-riviera-public-power-public-natural-gas-week-cus
 tomer-appreciation-1945238
LOCATION:Drowsy Poet @ The Foley Station 218 S. McKenzie St.\, Foley\, AL
END:VEVENT
