BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Baldwin Health: HEALTHY Women
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261007T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261007T000000
DTSTAMP:20261008T150156Z
UID:gz-baldwin-health-healthy-women-1927859@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title></head><body aria-di
 sabled="false" spellcheck="false"><hr fr-original-style="" style="clear: b
 oth\; user-select: none\; break-after: page\;" /><p><img src="https://res.
 cloudinary.com/micronetonline/image/upload/q_auto\,f_auto\,c_limit\,w_1879
 \,h_1576/v1789509384/tenants/e82e53eb-961d-4b13-bafd-8e5487751e05/f0718abf
 02f74b5cb23ae309e53c4584/BH-Healthy-Women-OCT-7-2026.jpg" style="width: 10
 0%\; position: relative\; max-width: 100%\; cursor: pointer\; padding: 0px
  1px\;" width="100%" height="676" fr-original-style="width: 100%\;" fr-ori
 ginal-class="fr-draggable" /><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>Join Baldwin Health
  on Oct 7 (11:30-1) for our Healthy Women luncheon! Enjoy a light meal &am
 p\; a physician panel on community wellness.</p><p>On October 7\, 2026\, f
 rom 11:30 AM to 1:00 PM\, Baldwin Health invites you to gather for an insp
 iring afternoon at our first annual Healthy Women luncheon. Designed to sp
 ark conversation and foster connections across our community\, this inaugu
 ral gathering brings together neighbors\, local leaders\, and health advoc
 ates around a shared commitment to well-being and vital living.</p><p>As g
 uests enjoy a light mid-day meal\, the heart of the event will unfold with
  an engaging panel discussion featuring premier physicians and leading pro
 viders from Baldwin Health. These expert practitioners\, deeply rooted in 
 our region\, will share their insights\, personal passions\, and practical
  wisdom on women&rsquo\;s wellness and the evolving healthcare landscape o
 f our community. From preventative measures to holistic approaches for eve
 ryday well-being\, the panel offers a rare opportunity to hear directly fr
 om the trusted doctors who care for our families every day.</p><p>Whether 
